        <button onclick="fecharModalPopupNinja(); abrirModalPix();" class="w-full py-4 px-6 rounded-2xl font-black text-xs uppercase tracking-wide bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-500 to-teal-400 hover:from-emerald-400 hover:to-teal-300 text-black shadow-xl shadow-emerald-500/30 hover:scale-[1.02] active:scale-95 transition-all flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
          <span>⚡ GARANTIR MEU ACESSO VIP POR R$ 9,90</span>
